; Qualified heads. A payload naming a type or a union case from another module
; spells it `alias/Name`, exactly as Core §4.0 spells it in a signature. The
; terminal is the language's own, so an imported type stays one token here too.
;
; canonical: (:shape (s/Point :x 1 :y 2) :variant (s/circle 2.0) :rows (s/Item [1 "SSD-1TB"]))

(:shape (s/Point :x 1 :y 2)
 :variant (s/circle 2.0)
 :rows (s/Item [1 "SSD-1TB"]))
